Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||03-20-2000||07:21 PM||||I had an interesting day today!<P>First I called shox.com they sell Ground Controls kit but they had me call Ground Control for the spring rate.<P>They however, do not give this information out and when asked became rude!<P>When I asked about the springs comeing out of their perches, they said "it will be worse with our kit." <BR>So I would have to buy 140.00 in extra crap to correct it! (helper springs) So I called Shox.com again and they had the same parts but for only 100.00.<P>Again they needed me to call Ground Control to O.K. it that I use Shox's helper springs.<P>When I called Ground Control back and said I would be useing Shox's helper springs, they got REALY MAD the guy on the phone shouted "It's not even worth it, I don't even know why we even deal with them. They always under cut us!" So I'm like Um I'll talk to ya later!<P>So I called Shox's back and explain what happened they appologized and were pissed about the situation.<P>I started a war all over stupid springs for my car? It just so happened that I talked to the purchaseing guy! <P>So..... to make a long story short I called Ryane motorsports talked to Daryl he was great and offered a solution other than helper springs, limiting straps, He said he would make a special mount to install straps if I liked at no charge!<P>Just goes to show customer service does matter!<P>  ||||reg||1
